It is half past six.
I am back in my flat.
I stand by the open window.
The day is at an end.
The sun is setting now.
But the sky is still clear and bright.
I look over the rooftops of Berlin.
The light is golden and beautiful.
The air at the window is fresh and cold.
I take my mobile phone.
I check the weather for tomorrow.
What does the forecast say?
The weather will be really nice.
It will not rain.
Tomorrow it will be sunny again.
Maybe I will ride my bicycle.
I look forward to the day.
I close the window and smile.
